v0.1.19.post1 is tagged and on PyPI.

Two fixes in this one:
- curator tag fix: corrects how curator version tags were resolved in hosted =
curator viewer resume flows
- executor hardening: docker backend for code execution now runs tasks as uid=
 1000 in the shipped sandbox image (note: a caller-supplied image via backend=
_params runs as uid 0, that's expected behavior)

No breaking API changes. Upgrade with: pip install --upgrade bespokelabs-cura=
tor=3D=3D0.1.19.post1

Release notes are in the engineering wiki under "Release notes: v0.1.19.post1=
" if you want the full details. Shout if anything looks wrong.
